   "en": "§ The Gemara continues its discussion of the recitations that can be stated in any language. «From where do we» derive that «Shema» may be recited in any language? «As it is written: “Hear, O Israel”» (Deuteronomy 6:4), which is homiletically interpreted to mean that it can be recited «in any language that you» can «hear» and understand."
